def author(register,source,compact):
 compact('b141','把止水墊壓縮、接縫偏移與長期鬆弛連到可驗證的水密性~Connect gasket compression, joint offset and long-term relaxation to verifiable watertightness',['segment-gaskets','vmt-rings'],r'''
壓縮量與溝槽幾何~Compression and groove geometry||止水墊靠受壓變形建立連續接觸，壓縮不足留通道，過度壓縮又可能損傷橡膠或環片邊緣。應以實際溝槽和接縫幾何計算，名義墊高不能單獨代表安裝後接觸狀態。~A gasket deforms under compression to establish continuous contact. Insufficient compression leaves paths, while excessive compression can damage rubber or concrete. Actual groove and joint geometry, not nominal gasket height alone, governs installed contact.||假設有效原高20 mm、壓後15 mm，壓縮率(20−15)/20=25%；非任何產品的允收值。~Assume effective initial height 20 mm and compressed height 15 mm; compression is 25%, not an acceptance value for any product.||量測止水墊、溝槽與實際縫寬，核對產品及環片核准圖面，對照力位移試驗曲線；品質主管需確認組合公差而非只驗單件尺寸，算例百分比不構成安裝規格。~Measure gasket, groove and actual gap against approved product and segment drawings and load-displacement curves; quality review checks combined tolerances, and the example percentage is not an installation specification.||溝槽過深即使墊高正確也可能壓縮不足，局部砂粒又造成點壓和旁側通道；只看外露高度一致會漏掉真正接觸不連續的區域。~An overly deep groove can undercompress a correctly sized gasket, while grit creates point loading and adjacent paths. Uniform visible height can therefore conceal discontinuous contact where leakage originates.
水頭與試驗壓差~Water head and test differential||水密需求取決於地下水頭、內外壓及局部高度，不只是隧道埋深。試驗壓差須代表核准設計情境並保留溫度、持時和變形條件，不能把一次短暫不漏水等同全壽期性能。~Watertight demand depends on head, internal-external pressure and elevation, not cover depth alone. Testing must represent approved pressure, temperature, duration and deformation, since brief absence of leakage does not establish lifetime performance.||假設淡水水頭50 m，壓差ρgh=0.4905 MPa；這是教學換算，未含設計裕度及暫態。~An assumed fresh-water head of 50 m gives ρgh=0.4905 MPa, a teaching conversion excluding design allowance and transients.||將試驗水壓計與試件高程校正，核對供水側及量測側壓力，觀察持時漏量與接縫幾何；試驗負責人依核准規格判定，不採用本課水頭自訂產品認證。~Correct pressure for gauge and specimen elevation and compare supply and measured sides while monitoring duration, leakage and gap geometry; test leads apply the approved specification, not an improvised product certification based on this example.||忽略感測器高程或管線損失會錯估實際試件壓差，過短持時又可能看不到慢漏；標稱水壓相同的兩次試驗因此未必有相同嚴格程度。~Ignoring gauge elevation or line loss misstates specimen pressure, while short duration misses slow leakage. Two tests with the same nominal pressure can therefore impose materially different demands.
錯台與接觸寬度~Offset and contact width||接縫錯台使兩側止水墊橫向錯開，接觸寬度下降並可能扭轉局部橡膠。縫寬和錯台應組合評估，同一錯台在不同壓縮量下可有不同水密效果，不能分項合格就推定組合合格。~Joint offset reduces overlapping contact and may twist rubber. Gap and offset interact, with the same offset behaving differently at different compression, so separate dimensional compliance does not establish combined watertightness.||假設簡化接觸寬30 mm、錯台5 mm，幾何重疊25 mm、保留83.3%；未包含橡膠側向變形。~Assume nominal contact width 30 mm and offset 5 mm; geometric overlap is 25 mm or 83.3%, excluding lateral rubber deformation.||以代表性最不利縫寬和錯台組合做核准水密試驗，記錄接觸印痕及漏點；測量安裝後幾何時保留方位，品質主管需確認組合落在試驗覆蓋範圍而非只比較單一公差。~Test approved adverse gap-offset combinations and record contact impressions and leak paths; preserve angular position in installed measurements and verify that combinations fall inside tested coverage rather than checking isolated tolerances.||兩項各自接近允許邊界時組合可能失水密，錯台集中於角部又更不利；只用平均縫寬會把局部接觸寬度不足掩蓋掉。~Two individually acceptable near-limit dimensions can fail when combined, especially at corners. Mean gap measurements conceal local loss of contact width and the continuous leakage path it can create.
壓縮反力與混凝土~Compression force and concrete||止水墊反力由接縫閉合傳到混凝土溝槽，過高剛度會增加組裝力與局部劈裂風險。水密接觸與環片局部強度必須協同，不可只選反力越大的墊材而忽略周邊混凝土。~Gasket compression transmits reaction into the concrete groove. Excess stiffness increases closure force and local splitting risk, so sealing contact and concrete resistance require joint design rather than selecting the stiffest gasket automatically.||假設每米密封線反力30 kN/m、長2 m，合力60 kN；局部溝槽應力仍需接觸面積與構造分析。~Assume line reaction 30 kN/m over 2 m; total force is 60 kN, while groove stress still requires contact area and detailing analysis.||以實際溝槽試件量測力位移並檢查混凝土裂縫，對照環片配筋與角部細節；試驗須涵蓋組裝變形，結構及止水設計者共同確認力與水密的相容性。~Measure load-displacement in representative grooves and inspect concrete cracking against reinforcement and corner details; include assembly deformation and require structural and seal designers to confirm compatible reaction and water resistance.||高反力可在尚未出現滲漏前損傷溝槽邊緣，裂損後幾何又降低密封效果；只用橡膠材料試驗無法看出這種系統性反作用。~High reaction can crack groove edges before leakage appears, and damaged geometry then undermines sealing. Rubber-only material tests do not reveal this coupled system failure mechanism under assembly loading.
長期應力鬆弛~Long-term stress relaxation||橡膠維持壓縮時接觸力可能隨時間下降，溫度與介質改變又影響老化。初始反力不是永久反力，壓縮永久變形和應力鬆弛也不是同一指標，必須按功能分別檢驗。~Compressed rubber can lose contact force over time, with temperature and medium affecting aging. Initial reaction is not permanent reaction, and compression set differs from stress relaxation; the two need separate functional assessment.||假設初始接觸力100 kN、特定試驗後70 kN，力保留70%；不得由此直接推算實際50年壽命。~Assume initial contact force 100 kN and 70 kN after a specified test; retention is 70%, not a direct prediction of 50-year service life.||核對加速老化試驗的溫度、時間及液體環境，測量老化後力位移與水密而非只看外觀；材料工程師需說明時間溫度外推的適用範圍，保留實際長期資料作核對。~Review accelerated-aging temperature, duration and medium and test aged force-displacement and watertightness, not appearance alone; materials engineers justify extrapolation scope and compare available long-term observations.||外觀無裂紋不表示接觸力未下降，使用不適當加速因子又可能誇大壽命；若老化後接縫再張開，原先短期試驗的水密證據不足以涵蓋。~An uncracked appearance does not prove retained contact force, and an inappropriate acceleration factor exaggerates life. Subsequent joint opening can exceed what the original short-term test actually demonstrated.
角部與交叉接點~Corners and intersecting joints||止水線在角部轉向並與其他接縫相交，局部壓縮和橡膠接合品質更複雜。直線段水密不能替代角部試驗，三維錯台或接縫轉角可能沿轉折處形成連續通道。~At corners the sealing line turns and meets other joints, creating complex local compression and rubber connections. Straight-length watertightness does not represent corners, where three-dimensional offset or rotation may create a continuous leakage route.||假設四角中一角存在未驗證接合，未覆蓋比例25%；角部風險不能用其占總周長很小而忽略。~If 1 of 4 assumed corners has an unverified connection, corner coverage is missing 25%; its small fraction of total perimeter does not justify ignoring the risk.||使用含實際角部和接縫交會的試件，記錄各向錯台與漏點位置；生產檢查保留角部接合和尺寸證據，任何修補由供應者及品質主管核准，不以直線拉伸試驗代替。~Use specimens with actual corners and joint intersections, recording offsets and leak locations; retain production evidence for corner joining and dimensions and approve repairs through supplier and quality leads rather than substituting straight-strip tensile tests.||角部接合微缺陷可能在低壓時不漏、變形後才連通，檢查只沿直線段便會漏失；若修補改變角部厚度，也可能使鄰近壓縮不均。~A small corner-connection defect may leak only after deformation, escaping straight-length inspection. Repairs that alter corner thickness can additionally create uneven compression immediately beside the repaired location.
黏貼與表面相容~Bonding and surface compatibility||黏貼使止水墊在運輸和組裝前維持位置，但最終水密仍依賴正確壓縮與連續接觸。溝槽污染、含水和不相容材料可能降低固定效果，必須遵循核准產品系統而非任意混用。~Bonding holds a gasket through handling and assembly, but final sealing still depends on compression and continuous contact. Contamination, moisture and incompatible materials weaken retention, requiring an approved system rather than improvised substitutions.||假設長2 m墊條有0.1 m未固定，缺失長度5%；即使比例小，局部移位仍可能切斷止水線。~If an assumed 2 m strip has 0.1 m unretained, the missing length is 5%; a small displaced portion can still interrupt the sealing line.||按供應者核准方法檢查表面狀態、材料批次及固定品質，安裝前核對是否移位或扭曲；任何相容性變更須有試驗與審查，課程不指定黏著劑、溶劑或施工配方。~Inspect surface condition, batch and retention under the supplier-approved method and check displacement or twisting before assembly; compatibility changes require tests and review, with no adhesive, solvent or application recipe prescribed here.||運輸中脫落再臨時塞回可能留下扭轉，外觀似乎就位卻接觸不連續；不相容材料也可能讓橡膠膨潤，尺寸正確不代表長期功能正常。~A strip that detaches and is hastily reseated may remain twisted with discontinuous contact. Incompatible materials can swell rubber, so apparently correct dimensions do not establish sustained functionality.
安裝污染與局部缺陷~Assembly contamination and local defects||砂粒、混凝土碎屑與墊條折疊會把連續接觸切成局部橋接，水沿未壓緊處繞行。這類缺陷不一定改變整體縫寬，因此需要可追溯外觀檢查與後續漏點對照。~Grit, concrete chips and folded rubber interrupt continuous contact and let water bypass uncompressed areas. Such defects need not change the overall gap, requiring traceable visual checks and later comparison with leakage locations.||假設一條2 m密封線有5 mm夾雜區，占0.25%；此比例不能代表水密損失只有0.25%。~An assumed 5 mm contaminated patch along a 2 m sealing line is 0.25%; it does not imply only 0.25% loss of watertight performance.||於核准組裝檢查點拍攝墊條連續性與槽面，記錄缺陷方位、環片序號及處置；發現夾雜或折疊需由品質負責人依程序處理，不能用增加閉合力自動彌補。~Photograph continuity and groove condition at approved inspection points with position, serial and response; quality leads resolve contamination or folds through the procedure rather than automatically applying more closure force.||增大組裝力可能把硬碎屑壓進橡膠並切傷，短時閉合更緊卻留下長期漏道；若缺陷照片未保留，後續漏水容易被錯怪為材料老化。~More closure force can embed hard debris and cut rubber, producing tighter initial closure but a lasting path. Without defect photographs, later leakage may be wrongly attributed to material aging.
公差組合與水密包絡~Tolerance combinations and sealing envelope||實際接縫同時有張開、錯台與轉角，水密試驗應涵蓋其組合而非各自最大值的孤立試驗。公差統計若有共同模具偏差也不獨立，分析須保留最不利但合理的情境。~Real joints combine opening, offset and rotation. Testing needs their combinations rather than isolated maxima, and shared mould bias makes tolerance statistics dependent. Preserve adverse but physically plausible combinations in the sealing envelope.||假設兩個獨立尺寸標準差1與2 mm，合成2.24 mm；若同向系統偏差則直接相加3 mm。~Two assumed independent dimensional standard deviations of 1 and 2 mm combine to 2.24 mm; same-direction systematic biases instead add to 3 mm.||將量產尺寸分布與安裝幾何對照試驗包絡，特別查共因偏差和未覆蓋角點；設計者需核准統計假設，超出試驗範圍的組合不能靠單項公差合格直接放行。~Compare production and installed dimensions against the tested envelope, checking common bias and uncovered corners; designers approve statistical assumptions, and combinations outside tested coverage cannot pass solely through individual tolerance compliance.||錯把共同偏差視為獨立會低估累積縫寬，未試過的張開加錯台組合又可能成為現地常態；高平均通過率不能掩蓋整批偏移。~Treating shared bias as independent understates accumulated gap, while untested opening-offset combinations may be routine in the field. A high average pass rate cannot conceal a systematic batch displacement.
水密試驗與追溯~Watertight tests and traceability||止水性能屬於橡膠、溝槽、環片與變形條件的整體，供應證書不能取代安裝品質紀錄。結案應讓漏點回溯到產品批次和實際幾何，同時說明哪些老化或變形情境尚未驗證。~Watertightness belongs to the combined rubber, groove, segment and deformation system. A product certificate does not replace installation records; closeout links leakage to batch and actual geometry and states unverified aging or movement conditions.||假設20組試件有18組達核准要求，通過90%；其餘2組需個別查因，不能用平均結果接受全部。~If 18 of an assumed 20 assemblies meet approved criteria, the pass rate is 90%; the remaining 2 need individual investigation rather than acceptance by averaging.||交付原始壓力時間、漏量、位移及照片，核對試件與現地產品和公差是否一致；材料、結構和品質負責人共同確認適用範圍及未解決項，避免把條件性通過寫成無條件保證。~Deliver raw pressure-time, leakage, displacement and photographs and check agreement with field products and tolerances; materials, structural and quality leads confirm applicability and unresolved items rather than turning conditional evidence into an unconditional guarantee.||只留下通過證書而沒有試驗幾何，就無法判斷現地錯台是否被涵蓋；批次或配方更動未登記則切斷證據鏈，後續無從辨認性能差異。~A pass certificate without test geometry cannot show whether field offset was covered. Undocumented batch or formulation changes break the evidence chain and prevent interpreting later differences in performance.
''')
 compact('b142','用軸力彎矩、接觸張開與螺栓行為檢核環片接縫~Check segment joints through axial force, bending, contact opening and bolt behavior',['hs2-segments','segment-gaskets'],r'''
軸力彎矩與偏心~Axial force bending and eccentricity||接縫軸壓和彎矩共同決定接觸區，偏心增加會使一側壓力升高而另一側可能張開。把接縫當完整混凝土斷面會高估拉力傳遞，應先確定是否容許拉開及由哪些元件承擔拉力。~Compression and bending determine contact area. Increasing eccentricity raises pressure on one edge and may open the other. Treating the joint as monolithic concrete overstates tensile transfer unless the actual tension-carrying components are identified.||假設N=1000 kN、M=50 kN·m，e=M/N=0.05 m；是否張開仍取決於接觸面幾何。~Assume N=1000 kN and M=50 kN·m; eccentricity e=M/N=0.05 m, with opening still dependent on contact geometry.||以一致正負號繪製接縫N-M工況，對照全接觸、局部接觸和張開模型；用接縫試驗或核准數值分析驗證接觸範圍，不能只用混凝土抗壓值判定接縫安全。~Plot joint N-M cases with consistent signs and compare full, partial and open-contact models; verify contact through tests or approved analysis rather than deciding joint adequacy from concrete compressive strength alone.||忽略偏心會低估局部壓碎，錯用完整斷面拉應力又會假設不存在的抗拉連續性；兩種誤用可能同時讓接縫看似剛硬且承載充足。~Ignoring eccentricity understates local crushing, while monolithic tensile stress assumes nonexistent continuity. Together these mistakes can make a joint appear both stiffer and stronger than its actual contact permits.
接觸核心與張開~Contact kern and opening||矩形接觸面在線性全壓條件下有核心範圍，偏心超出後會出現計算拉應力，表示全接觸假設需改變。這不是混凝土突然破壞，而是應轉成不承拉接觸及連接件共同作用模型。~A rectangular contact has a kern under linear compression. Beyond it, calculated tension signals loss of the full-contact assumption rather than immediate concrete failure, requiring no-tension contact and connector action to be modeled together.||假設接觸深度h=0.30 m，核心界線h/6=0.05 m；此幾何值不是所有接縫的固定門檻。~For assumed contact depth h=0.30 m, the kern boundary is h/6=0.05 m, a geometry-specific value rather than a universal joint threshold.||量測接觸面尺寸及平整度，以壓敏材料或位移計檢查受載後接觸分布；分析中逐步檢視張開位置與螺栓受力，將幾何不完美納入而非只檢查名義矩形。~Measure contact dimensions and flatness and observe loaded contact with appropriate film or gauges; track opening and bolt force in analysis, including imperfections rather than checking only a nominal rectangular surface.||接觸面翹曲可使全壓理論失效更早，若仍用完整面積平均壓力會掩蓋角部高應力；試驗與模型差異需先查接觸幾何。~Warped faces can invalidate full contact earlier than ideal theory, and mean pressure over the whole area conceals concentrated corner stress. Model-test discrepancies should therefore prompt a contact-geometry review first.
螺栓預力與摩擦離散~Bolt preload and friction scatter||鎖付扭矩透過螺紋和支承摩擦轉成預力，摩擦差異會讓同扭矩產生不同拉力。預力維持接觸但也增加局部荷載，不能將扭矩值本身當成已驗證的螺栓受力。~Tightening torque becomes preload through thread and bearing friction, so equal torque can produce different tension. Preload maintains contact while adding local loads, making torque alone insufficient evidence of actual bolt force.||假設示意T=KdF，K=0.2、d=0.024 m、F=100 kN，T=480 N·m；非現場鎖付規格。~For assumed T=KdF with K=0.2, d=0.024 m and F=100 kN, T=480 N·m, not a field tightening specification.||由合格連接件試驗建立摩擦與預力關係，檢查潤滑狀態、批號及量測方法；現場依核准程序查核，必要時用直接或間接張力證據，不能照教學扭矩自行鎖付。~Establish friction-preload behavior through qualified connector testing with lubrication, batch and measurement records; field verification follows approved procedures and appropriate tension evidence, never the teaching torque as an instruction.||摩擦偏大時扭矩達標但預力不足，偏小時又可能過度拉伸；若接縫後續鬆弛未被追蹤，初始合格紀錄也不能證明長期接觸狀態。~High friction gives inadequate preload at the target torque, while low friction can overstrain the bolt. Untracked relaxation also means initial compliance does not prove sustained joint contact throughout service.
轉動剛度與非線性~Rotational stiffness and nonlinearity||接縫彎矩對轉角曲線通常隨接觸區縮小和螺栓啟動而改變斜率，不是一個固定彈簧。全環模型若使用等效剛度，必須說明載重範圍和軸力條件，避免把初始斜率外推到大轉角。~Moment-rotation behavior changes as contact shrinks and bolts engage, rather than remaining one constant spring. Equivalent ring-model stiffness therefore needs a stated moment range and axial force, preventing initial stiffness from being extrapolated to large rotation.||假設某區間ΔM=20 kN·m、Δθ=0.002 rad，割線增量剛度10 MN·m/rad；非全曲線常數。~For assumed ΔM=20 kN·m and Δθ=0.002 rad, incremental secant stiffness is 10 MN·m/rad, not a constant for the entire curve.||在多軸力情境試驗量測彎矩轉角及張開，區分初始、割線和卸載剛度；設計者應比較全環對不同剛度的敏感度，並保留接縫模型適用範圍與實驗來源。~Measure moment, rotation and opening at several axial loads, distinguishing initial, secant and unloading stiffness; designers assess ring sensitivity and retain the applicable range and experimental basis of each joint model.||固定高剛度會低估局部轉角並錯分彎矩，固定低剛度又可能低估環整體約束；模型看似收斂不代表接縫接觸機制已被正確描述。~A fixed high stiffness understates local rotation and misallocates moment, while a fixed low value understates ring restraint. Numerical convergence alone does not establish physically correct contact behavior in the joint.
接縫轉角與止水張開~Joint rotation and seal opening||結構接縫的轉角會在止水線位置放大或減少縫寬，水密檢核需要知道止水墊距轉動中心的距離。只看接縫中心位移可能漏掉邊緣張開，結構與防水模型必須使用相同幾何。~Joint rotation changes opening at the sealing line according to distance from the rotation center. Center displacement can miss edge opening, requiring structural and waterproofing models to share the same geometry and sign convention.||假設小轉角θ=0.003 rad、止水線距中心0.2 m，轉動造成張開θy=0.6 mm；另加平移分量。~Assume small rotation θ=0.003 rad and sealing-line offset y=0.2 m; rotational opening is θy=0.6 mm, added to translational opening.||同時量測接縫中心和邊緣位移，與止水墊試驗包絡對照；結構及防水工程師確認轉角方向、偏心與錯台組合，不能用不同基準的兩份報告各自宣布合格。~Measure center and edge movement together and compare the gasket test envelope; structural and waterproofing engineers align rotation, eccentricity and offset combinations rather than separately approving reports with inconsistent geometry.||若轉動中心位置假設錯誤，會把張開側和壓縮側顛倒，漏水位置因而無法解釋；以中心平均縫寬代替止水線縫寬會低估需求。~An incorrect rotation center can reverse predicted opening and compression sides and mislocate leakage. Substituting mean center gap for the actual seal-line gap understates the deformation demand on the gasket.
錯縫排列與環間傳力~Staggered joints and ring interaction||相鄰環錯開縱向接縫可改變彎矩與剪力傳遞，但效果取決於環間接觸、連接件與摩擦。不能把錯縫自動等同完整連續襯砌，施工階段尚未形成同樣約束時尤其需要分開分析。~Staggering longitudinal joints changes bending and shear transfer through adjacent rings, depending on contact, connectors and friction. It does not automatically create a monolithic lining, especially before construction-stage restraints are established.||假設環間剪力200 kN由4個有效連接區平均分擔，平均50 kN/區；實際分配仍可能偏心。~Assume 200 kN inter-ring shear shared equally by 4 effective connection zones; the mean is 50 kN per zone, with actual eccentric distribution unresolved.||以多環模型或代表性試驗檢查環間滑移和連接件受力，核對實際錯縫角度及施工順序；分析者需比較低摩擦和局部脫開情境，不能只採理想黏結模型。~Use multiring analysis or representative tests to examine slip and connector force with actual stagger and sequence; compare low-friction and local separation cases rather than relying solely on ideal bonding.||把環間完全黏結會高估荷載重分配能力，若某環接觸不足，原先假定的旁路傳力可能消失；單環試驗又不能直接證明多環錯縫效果。~Perfect inter-ring bonding overstates redistribution. Inadequate contact can remove an assumed alternate load path, while a single-ring test cannot directly demonstrate the effects of staggered multiring interaction in service.
循環載重與鬆弛~Cyclic loading and relaxation||列車、溫度或水壓變動使接縫反覆變形，螺栓預力可能鬆弛且接觸面磨耗。循環次數只有配合幅值、平均力和連接細節才有疲勞意義，不能單憑次數推斷必然破壞。~Traffic, thermal and water-pressure cycles repeatedly deform joints, potentially relaxing preload and wearing contacts. Cycle count has fatigue meaning only alongside amplitude, mean force and connector detail, not as a standalone failure prediction.||假設每日100次代表循環、30年、365日/年，總次數1,095,000；不含不同幅值合併。~Assume 100 representative cycles per day for 30 years at 365 days/year; total count is 1095000, without combining different amplitude ranges.||量測代表載重譜和螺栓力或接縫開合，區分服務循環與施工一次性載重；疲勞檢核使用適用細節與試驗資料，維護計畫保留預力或位移基線以識別長期改變。~Measure representative spectra and bolt force or joint opening, separating service cycles from one-time construction loads; use appropriate detail and test evidence for fatigue and retain preload or movement baselines for long-term comparison.||用總循環數套單一高幅值會過度保守，完全忽略少數高幅值又可能危險；若監測只記日平均，接縫反覆開合的真實幅度會被抹去。~Applying one high amplitude to every cycle exaggerates damage, while ignoring rare large cycles can be unsafe. Daily averages erase the actual opening-closing amplitudes that govern connection behavior.
局部裂縫與連接錨定~Local cracks and connector anchorage||螺栓或榫鍵把力集中輸入環片，周邊混凝土需要足夠錨定與劈裂控制。整體接縫力小不代表局部安全，孔位、公差和缺角會改變有效受力區，須結合構造細節檢查。~Bolts and keys introduce concentrated forces requiring adequate anchorage and splitting control. Modest global joint force does not ensure local safety; hole location, tolerances and chips change the effective resisting region and must be checked with detailing.||假設錨定區合力120 kN、有效受力面0.02 m²，名義應力6 MPa；不是混凝土局部承載驗算全式。~Assumed anchorage force 120 kN over effective area 0.02 m² gives nominal stress 6 MPa, not a complete local concrete-capacity check.||核對連接件位置、配筋及混凝土缺陷，利用核准試驗或分析檢查拔出、劈裂和局部壓碎；損傷照片須能追到環片及接縫位置，由結構工程師決定可否修復使用。~Check connector location, reinforcement and defects and assess pullout, splitting and crushing through approved analysis or tests; trace damage photographs to segment and joint for structural review of repairability and use.||孔周裂縫可能使有效錨定逐步減少，外露螺栓仍完好卻已失去設計傳力；若只檢查金屬件而不查混凝土，局部失效會被漏掉。~Cracking around the recess can progressively reduce anchorage while the exposed bolt still looks intact. Inspecting metal alone misses loss of the intended load path within the surrounding concrete.
足尺試驗與邊界~Full-scale tests and boundaries||接縫試驗需重現軸力、彎矩、接觸與支承，試驗架剛度也會影響量到的轉角。足尺不代表所有邊界都正確，須區分試體變形、設備柔度與局部就位，才能用於模型校準。~Joint tests must reproduce force, moment, contact and support, while frame stiffness influences measured rotation. Full size does not guarantee correct boundaries; separate specimen deformation, machine compliance and seating before calibrating a model.||假設總量測轉角0.004 rad、設備柔度貢獻0.001 rad，試體轉角0.003 rad；扣除需有校準證據。~Assume total measured rotation 0.004 rad with machine contribution 0.001 rad; specimen rotation is 0.003 rad, provided the subtraction has calibration evidence.||使用獨立位移量測區分試件與試驗架，記錄載入順序、軸力及接觸狀態；模型先預測再與試驗比對，差異需檢查邊界和材料，不以任意調剛度消除全部殘差。~Use independent measurements to distinguish specimen and frame, documenting sequence, axial load and contact; predict before comparing the test and investigate boundaries and material rather than arbitrarily adjusting stiffness to erase every residual.||設備就位滑移若被當成接縫柔度，模型會過度柔軟，反過來忽略局部量測可把框架轉動扣錯；錯誤校準會污染所有後續環分析。~Frame seating slip mistaken for joint flexibility makes the model too soft, while poor local measurements cause incorrect rotation subtraction. Either calibration error propagates into every subsequent ring analysis.
接縫驗證與工程簽認~Joint verification and engineering signoff||接縫驗收需要連結結構、水密與組裝幾何，而不是三份互不對照的合格表。交接保存最不利組合、試驗覆蓋與剩餘假設，確保營運期檢查知道哪些裂縫或開合屬模型失效訊號。~Joint acceptance links structural, waterproofing and assembly evidence rather than three unrelated pass sheets. Handover retains adverse combinations, test coverage and assumptions so operational inspections recognize signs invalidating the model.||假設10種設計組合中8種經直接試驗、2種靠分析外推，直接覆蓋80%；外推2種需明列限制。~If 8 of an assumed 10 design combinations have direct testing and 2 rely on analysis, direct coverage is 80%; limits of the other 2 remain explicit.||從一組最不利N-M與錯台條件追查到試驗、產品和現地紀錄，檢查各自坐標及版本；結構、防水及品質負責人共同確認外推依據，不以整體通過率替代單一關鍵組合的審查。~Trace one adverse N-M-offset combination through tests, products and field records with consistent coordinates and versions; structural, sealing and quality leads jointly approve extrapolation rather than using an overall pass rate to waive a critical combination.||結構分析與水密試驗採不同張開定義會造成介面空白，所有報告各自合格仍可能漏掉真實組合；未記錄外推範圍也會讓後續修改超出原驗證。~Different opening definitions in structural and sealing evidence create an interface gap despite separate approvals. Missing extrapolation limits also allows later changes to exceed the original verification unnoticed.
''')
 compact('b143','以環隙體積、漿體時變行為與環片浮力驗證盾尾背填~Verify tail-void backfill through annular volume, time-dependent grout and lining buoyancy',['sika-tbm','fhwa'],r'''
理論環隙與超挖~Theoretical annulus and overbreak||盾殼退出後留下的環隙須由背填材料接替支承，理論圓環體積只是基準。超挖、地層變形與盾體姿態使實際空隙不同，不能用單一名義體積推定填充已完整。~Backfill replaces support in the void left by the shield. A circular annular volume is only a reference, since overbreak, ground deformation and shield attitude change the actual space; nominal volume alone does not prove complete filling.||假設開挖徑6.4 m、環片外徑6.2 m、環寬1.5 m，V=π(6.4²−6.2²)×1.5/4=2.969 m³。~Assume excavation diameter 6.4 m, segment outer diameter 6.2 m and width 1.5 m; V=π(6.4²−6.2²)×1.5/4=2.969 m³.||核對刀盤與環片幾何、環寬及盾體軌跡，將實際注入量換算到每環共同基準；對偏心與超挖做情境範圍，填充判斷需另有壓力、位移或檢查證據。~Check cutter and segment geometry, ring width and shield path and normalize delivered volume by ring; bound eccentricity and overbreak, requiring pressure, movement or inspection evidence in addition to quantity when assessing fill.||名義體積足夠仍可能沿裂隙外流而留下頂部空洞，地層擠入也會減小容積；把任何超額都當浪費或任何達量都當合格都會誤判。~Nominally adequate grout can escape through fissures while leaving a crown void, whereas ground intrusion reduces space. Treating all excess as waste or all target volume as successful filling both misinterpret the balance.
輸送收支與有效填充~Delivery balance and effective filling||泵送總量包含管線儲存、回流和外漏，只有到達目標環隙的部分才與支承有關。每環收支需追蹤時間延遲，否則計量器在本環記錄的材料可能到下一環才排出。~Pumped quantity includes line storage, returns and leakage; only delivery into the intended annulus contributes there. Ring accounting needs transport delay because volume registered in one ring may arrive during the next.||假設計量4.0 m³、管線儲增0.3 m³、確認回流0.2 m³，未扣其他漏失前可歸入3.5 m³。~Assume metered volume 4.0 m³, line-storage increase 0.3 m³ and confirmed returns 0.2 m³; 3.5 m³ remains before other losses are resolved.||以儲槽質量或容積校準計量器，記錄回流和清洗材料並對齊環號時序；比較理論空隙及注入口分配，未閉合差額由灌漿工程師查因，不以泵浦轉數直接當有效填充證明。~Calibrate metering against tank mass or volume, record returns and cleaning material and align ring timing; compare annulus and port distribution and investigate unclosed differences rather than using pump revolutions as proof of effective fill.||管線清洗液若混入注入量會虛增填充，計量滑漏又會使材料到量不足；沒有收支分項時，壓力正常也可能只是管內阻力而非環隙填滿。~Including flush liquid inflates fill quantity, while meter slip understates missing delivery. Without separate balances, normal pressure may reflect pipe resistance rather than a filled annulus behind the lining.
高程壓差與傳遞~Elevation pressure and transmission||漿體自重使不同高程注入口壓力不同，管線損失又使泵端壓力高於環隙。環片和地層實際承受的是局部外壓，必須以相同高程及量測位置比較，避免將泵壓直接套到結構。~Grout weight changes pressure with elevation while line loss separates pump and annulus readings. Ground and lining respond to local pressure, requiring common elevation and sensor-location references rather than direct use of pump pressure as structural loading.||假設漿密度1800 kg/m³、高差6 m，靜壓差ρgΔz=105.95 kPa；流動時另有管損。~Assume grout density 1800 kg/m³ and elevation difference 6 m; static difference ρgΔz=105.95 kPa, with additional losses during flow.||核對各壓力計與注入口高程、零點及流量，將靜態與流動讀值分開；分析者需辨識高泵壓低流量的堵塞可能，所有控制界線由工程核准，算例不提供注漿壓力指令。~Check sensor and port elevations, zero and flow, separating static from flowing readings; analysts investigate blockage when high pump pressure accompanies low delivery, with limits approved by engineers rather than supplied by this example.||把低處壓力當頂部壓力會高估頂部填充或錯估結構載重，堵塞管線又可形成高壓假象；若只記單一泵表，難以定位問題所在。~Using a low-level reading for the crown overstates filling pressure or misstates loading, and blockage creates a high-pressure illusion. One pump gauge alone cannot localize the discrepancy in the delivery system.
流變與泌水分離~Rheology and bleed separation||漿體需流入狹窄環隙又保持均勻，屈服阻力過高限制擴散，泌水則使初始體積在硬化前縮小。流動度、泌水及凝結時間必須一起評估，不能用最容易泵送作唯一品質目標。~Grout must enter narrow voids while remaining uniform. Excess yield resistance limits spread, whereas bleeding reduces effective volume before hardening. Flow, bleed and set time require joint assessment rather than easiest pumping as the sole quality target.||假設1 L試樣析水30 mL，泌水比例3%；不等於現地空隙必定增加3%。~If an assumed 1 L sample releases 30 mL water, bleed is 3%; this does not mean the field void necessarily increases by 3%.||按核准方法同時試驗流動性、泌水和時間變化，保留溫度、材料批次與混合歷程；灌漿工程師需核對試樣和現場剪切環境，將未驗證尺度轉換列為限制。~Test flow, bleed and time dependence using approved methods with temperature, batches and mixing history; grout engineers compare specimen and field shear conditions and identify unverified scale transfer explicitly.||高流動性可能伴隨大量泌水而在頂部留下空隙，過度增稠又可能只充滿注入口附近；單一流動度合格無法排除這兩種相反失效。~High flowability may come with bleeding that leaves crown voids, while thick grout fills only near ports. Passing one flow test cannot exclude either of these opposing failure mechanisms in practice.
凝結時間與輸送延遲~Setting time and delivery delay||材料從混合到到達環隙經歷管路停留與剪切，凝結或增稠會改變可用流動時間。時間估算需包括停機和死區，平均停留短並不保證所有材料都未老化，尤其多組分系統更需明確控制體。~Mixed material ages and shears during transport, changing its workable time. Include stoppages and dead zones: a short mean residence does not guarantee fresh material everywhere, especially in multicomponent systems with distinct mixing locations.||假設有效管容0.12 m³、流量0.004 m³/s，名義停留30 s；不含停機和非理想混合。~Assume effective line volume 0.12 m³ and flow 0.004 m³/s; nominal residence is 30 s, excluding stoppages and nonideal mixing.||將混合位置、管線容積、流量及材料時間試驗對齊，檢查停機重啟是否產生老化團塊；設備和材料負責人共同核准方案，本課不提供促凝比例或管路處理操作。~Align mixing location, volume and flow with time-dependent material tests and inspect restart evidence for aged lumps; equipment and materials leads approve the scheme, with no accelerator ratio or line-treatment procedure prescribed here.||只看平均停留會漏掉死區已凝材料，壓降逐漸增加可能被誤認為環隙已滿；在錯誤判讀下減少填充，會把堵塞問題轉成背填空洞。~Mean residence misses hardened material in dead zones, and rising loss may be mistaken for a full annulus. Reducing delivery on that interpretation turns a line blockage into an unfilled support void.
環片浮力與抬升~Lining buoyancy and uplift||新鮮漿體對環片產生浮力，未形成硬化支承前的環片重量、連接與約束共同抵抗抬升。局部非均勻壓力還會造成轉動，不能只用總注入量推定環片位置穩定。~Fresh grout creates buoyancy resisted by lining weight, connections and restraints before hard support forms. Uneven local pressures also cause rotation, so total delivery cannot establish positional stability of the ring.||假設外壓近似靜水分布，有效排開漿體體積15 m³（非混凝土體積）、密度1200 kg/m³，浮力176.58 kN；環重12 t為117.72 kN，未計約束淨上力58.86 kN。~Assume near-hydrostatic external pressure and effective displaced grout volume of 15 m³, not concrete volume, at 1200 kg/m³; buoyancy is 176.58 kN. A 12 t ring weighs 117.72 kN, leaving 58.86 kN before restraints.||同步環片高程、姿態與注入分區時序，核對新鮮漿體密度及支承形成時間；結構工程師需評估接縫與臨時約束路徑，不能把淨上力直接變成未核准的固定或加載措施。~Synchronize ring elevation and attitude with zonal injection and check fresh density and support-development time; structural engineers assess joint and temporary restraint paths rather than converting net uplift into an unapproved fixing or loading measure.||環片抬升會改變接縫張開與軌道淨空，若高程監測太晚只看到硬化後位置，短暫移動造成的接縫損傷可能被漏掉。~Uplift changes joint opening and track clearance. If elevation is checked only after hardening, temporary movement and the joint damage it caused may remain absent from the record used for acceptance.
早齡剛度與荷載接替~Early stiffness and load transfer||背填從流體逐漸變成可傳遞剪力與壓縮的固體，這段轉換控制地層和襯砌何時互相支承。早期抗壓強度與剛度不是同一性質，支承模型需使用相應時間的材料狀態。~Backfill changes from fluid to a solid carrying compression and shear, governing when ground and lining support one another. Early compressive strength differs from stiffness, so support models must use the material state at the relevant age.||假設等效壓縮模數50 MPa、應變0.001，線彈性示意應力0.05 MPa=50 kPa；不代表破壞強度。~Assume compression modulus 50 MPa and strain 0.001; illustrative elastic stress is 0.05 MPa=50 kPa, not failure strength.||以代表齡期試驗取得強度和變形資料，對照盾尾通過、灌漿與地層變形時間；模型需分列未凝、過渡和硬化狀態，不能只用最終試體結果推回剛完成一環的支承。~Test strength and deformation at representative ages and align tail passage, injection and ground movement; distinguish fluid, transitional and hardened states instead of projecting final specimen performance back to a newly completed ring.||以最終高模數套早期環隙會高估支承而低估沉陷，反之忽略硬化又可能錯估長期環彎矩；同一材料需要隨時間更新而非單一常數。~Using final stiffness at early age overstates support and understates settlement, while ignoring later hardening misstates ring moments. The same material therefore needs time-dependent characterization rather than one constant.
收縮與失水容積~Shrinkage and volume loss||泌水、化學收縮與地層吸水會改變背填硬化後容積，各機制發生時間和位置不同。試樣自由收縮不等於現場受約束空洞，但可提示需要核對密實度與長期接觸，不能只看初期注滿。~Bleeding, chemical shrinkage and ground absorption alter hardened volume at different times and locations. Free specimen shrinkage is not directly a restrained field void, but signals a need to examine density and lasting contact beyond initial filling.||假設初始填充3 m³、自由體積縮減2%，變化0.06 m³；現地是否成空洞取決於補給與約束。~Assume initial fill 3 m³ and free volumetric reduction 2%; change is 0.06 m³, with field void formation dependent on replenishment and restraint.||量測材料體積穩定性、泌水與吸水情境，對照現地壓力和後期檢查；灌漿及地工工程師需區分材料本身縮減和外部流失，不把自由試樣百分比直接當空洞率。~Measure volume stability, bleeding and absorption scenarios against field pressure and later inspections; grout and geotechnical engineers distinguish material reduction from external loss rather than equating free-sample percentage with field void ratio.||地層吸水可能使注入口附近迅速增稠而遠端未填，後期收縮又加大接觸缺口；若只在早期量一次漿體強度，便看不到這些容積機制。~Ground absorption can thicken grout near ports before distant voids fill, and later shrinkage enlarges contact gaps. A single early strength measurement does not reveal either of these volume-related processes.
空洞檢測與非唯一性~Void detection and nonuniqueness||襯砌背後缺陷可由聲學、雷達或其他核准方法提供線索，但反射異常也可能來自含水、材料界面或鋼筋。檢測須校準到現場構造並有獨立查證，不能把色圖每個異常直接當空洞。~Approved acoustic, radar or other methods can indicate defects behind lining, but reflections also arise from water, interfaces and steel. Calibrate to actual construction and verify independently rather than labeling every colored anomaly a void.||假設100 m²檢查面中10 m²無有效資料，可評估覆蓋90%；未量區不能併入無缺陷面積。~If an assumed 100 m² inspection area includes 10 m² without valid data, coverage is 90%; unmeasured areas cannot count as defect-free.||用已知構造或代表試件評估檢測辨識能力，將異常與注入量、壓力及沉陷交叉比對；確認範圍由工程師指定合適方法，任何鑽查需另有核准，課程不提供現場穿孔步驟。~Assess detection on known construction or representative specimens and compare anomalies with quantities, pressures and movement; engineers select confirmation methods, with any intrusive investigation separately approved rather than instructed by this course.||鋼筋反射被誤當空洞會造成無謂修復，潮濕漿體又可能掩蓋真缺陷；沒有檢出限與盲區圖的檢測報告無法支持全面密實宣稱。~Mistaking steel reflections for voids prompts unnecessary repair, while wet grout may conceal real defects. Without detection limits and blind-zone maps, a survey cannot support a claim of complete filling.
背填證據工程移交~Backfill evidence and handover||背填品質是體積、材料、壓力和幾何的一致證據，不是單一到量記錄。交接應把每環分區資料與環片位置、地層和檢測相連，讓後續發現滲漏或沉陷時可追查原始成因。~Backfill quality requires consistent volume, material, pressure and geometry evidence rather than one delivered-quantity record. Link each ring and zone to lining location, geology and inspection so later leakage or settlement remains diagnosable.||假設10環中8環收支閉合且證據完整，覆蓋80%；其餘2環要逐環列出缺項與審查決定。~If 8 of an assumed 10 rings have closed balances and complete evidence, coverage is 80%; the other 2 require individual gaps and review decisions.||抽查一環由材料批次到泵送、注入口、姿態和後期檢測的全鏈，核對時鐘與版本；灌漿、結構及地工負責人共同簽認限制，不能將整體平均充填比代替每環異常處置。~Trace a ring through batches, pumping, ports, pose and later inspection with consistent clocks and versions; grout, structural and geotechnical leads accept limitations explicitly instead of substituting an average fill ratio for individual anomaly resolution.||只保留每班總量會使局部空洞無法定位，材料批次更換又可能與硬化差異錯配；資料齊全但時間不同步仍不能建立可信的因果鏈。~Shift totals cannot locate local voids, and unaligned batch changes misassign hardening differences. Even complete records fail to establish a credible causal chain when their timestamps are inconsistent across systems.
''')
 compact('b144','以始發到達介面、地層水文和暫態受力驗證止水轉換~Verify launch and reception sealing transitions through interfaces, hydrogeology and temporary load paths',['geo','herrenknecht-epb'],r'''
始發到達控制體~Launch and reception control volumes||穿越井壁時，機器、井體和地層之間的支護與止水邊界會改變，不能只檢查最終貫通狀態。應按位置畫出每個階段仍存在的屏障和力流，特別辨識暫時只剩單一道防護的區間。~Crossing a shaft wall changes support and sealing boundaries among machine, shaft and ground. Checking only final breakthrough misses transitions; map barriers and load paths by position, identifying intervals with only one remaining barrier.||假設4個階段的獨立屏障數為2、1、2、2，最低為1；平均1.75不能代表關鍵階段冗餘。~For assumed barrier counts 2,1,2 and 2 across four stages, the minimum is 1; the mean 1.75 does not describe redundancy at the critical transition.||用核准施工階段圖逐項對照井壁、止水裝置、地層處理與機器位置，做介面責任審查；每個屏障需有驗證證據與失效條件，不能以最終成品圖代替暫態審查。~Review approved stage drawings against shaft wall, seals, treated ground and machine position with assigned interface owners; each barrier needs evidence and invalidation conditions, not only a final-state drawing.||屏障移交時序若有空檔，總體設計看似完整卻可能短暫直接連通水土；責任只按專業分工而無介面確認，會讓關鍵空檔無人審查。~A timing gap between barriers can temporarily connect water and ground despite an apparently complete overall design. Discipline-only responsibilities without interface review leave the critical interval unowned and unchecked.
水頭基準與外水力~Head datum and external water force||井內外水頭差決定潛在流入驅動，地表水位、承壓含水層和施工排水不一定一致。壓力計高程與測段連通性需清楚，不能把井深或某個遠處水位直接當成所有位置的水頭。~The head difference across the shaft drives potential inflow, but surface level, confined groundwater and construction drainage may differ. Gauge elevation and interval connectivity matter; neither shaft depth nor one distant water level represents every location.||假設淡水水頭差20 m，Δp=196.2 kPa；作用於10 m²平面合力1.962 MN，未計壓力梯度。~Assume freshwater head difference 20 m; Δp=196.2 kPa and force on a uniformly loaded 10 m² plane is 1.962 MN, excluding pressure variation.||用多深度水位或孔壓資料建立水頭範圍，將感測器高程換到共同基準，核對抽排水時序；地工與結構工程師需確認最不利水情及平面受壓假設，不將算例當測試加壓值。~Build head ranges from multilevel observations with a common elevation datum and pumping timeline; geotechnical and structural engineers confirm adverse water conditions and uniform-load assumptions rather than treating the example as a test pressure.||把表壓與絕對壓混用或忽略承壓層會錯估外水力，長期排水又可能改變鄰近地層有效應力；只保護井口而忽略周邊沉陷並不完整。~Confusing gauge and absolute pressure or missing a confined aquifer misstates water load. Prolonged pumping also changes surrounding effective stress, so protecting only the opening overlooks neighboring settlement effects.
處理體連續性與薄弱通道~Treated-ground continuity and weak paths||地層處理體的作用取決於連續性和與井壁的接合，平均強度或滲透性不能排除細小貫通通道。幾何覆蓋、施工偏差和天然透水夾層須一起審查，避免把處理體當成理想均質方塊。~A treated block depends on continuity and its interface with the wall. Average strength or permeability does not exclude a narrow connected path, requiring geometry, construction deviations and permeable interbeds to be assessed together.||假設串聯兩層各厚1 m，k1=10⁻⁶、k2=10⁻⁸ m/s，法向等效k=2/(10⁶+10⁸)=1.98×10⁻⁸ m/s；旁通不適用。~Assume two 1 m layers in series with k1=10⁻⁶ and k2=10⁻⁸ m/s; normal equivalent k=1.98×10⁻⁸ m/s, excluding bypass paths.||將處理範圍、鑽孔軌跡及驗證試驗放在三維坐標，特別查井壁接觸與邊緣；地工工程師需說明取樣能否排除連通弱帶，不能只以少數高強度試件代表整個體積。~Integrate treatment geometry, borehole paths and verification in three dimensions, focusing on wall contact and edges; engineers justify whether sampling excludes connected weak zones rather than representing the whole block with a few strong specimens.||高強度區樣本容易取得，弱通道卻可能被漏採；串聯低透水公式若實際有旁通便失效，開口後集中滲流可能遠高於平均材料估算。~Strong areas are easier to sample while weak paths may be missed. A series-layer calculation fails in the presence of bypass, and concentrated inflow can greatly exceed the average-material estimate.
滲流梯度與尺度~Seepage gradient and scale||水頭差除路徑長形成平均梯度，真正最短路徑可能沿井壁界面或裂縫。提高處理厚度不一定同比降低局部梯度，若缺陷使路徑縮短，流失風險需用連通幾何與土性共同評估。~Head difference over path length gives a mean gradient, but the shortest route may follow a wall interface or crack. Greater treatment thickness does not proportionally reduce local gradients if a defect shortens the actual flow path.||假設水頭差10 m、有效路徑5 m，i=2；若裂縫路徑僅1 m則i=10，未計三維流場。~Assume head difference 10 m over effective path 5 m, giving i=2; a 1 m crack path gives i=10, before three-dimensional flow effects.||由地質、接合面與孔壓觀測建立可行流路，對比完好體及局部缺陷情境；試驗和模型應由地工工程師確認尺度，梯度算例不能作現場注水或開口許可。~Construct plausible paths from geology, interfaces and pressure observations and compare intact and defective scenarios; geotechnical engineers validate test scale, and the gradient exercise does not authorize injection or opening work.||以處理體總厚度當最短流路會低估界面漏水，若只量遠處孔壓也可能漏掉局部高梯度；流量初小但帶砂可意味通道正在演化。~Using total block thickness as the shortest path understates interface leakage, while distant pressure readings miss local gradients. Initially small flow carrying fines can indicate an evolving pathway rather than a harmless stable condition.
止水環壓縮與偏心~Sealing-ring compression and eccentricity||始發到達止水裝置需適應機器外形與偏心，環狀接觸不均時局部壓縮不足可能先漏。機器姿態與井口幾何是共同介面，不能只由止水材料單方證書判定整體可用。~Launch or reception seals must accommodate machine shape and eccentricity. Uneven annular contact leaves locally undercompressed zones, making machine pose and opening geometry a shared interface beyond what a material certificate alone can establish.||假設名義壓縮12 mm、偏心4 mm，簡化兩側壓縮8與16 mm；實際柔性變形需試驗確認。~Assume nominal compression 12 mm and eccentricity 4 mm; simplified opposite compressions are 8 and 16 mm, with actual flexibility requiring testing.||將井口測量、機器外徑與姿態資料對照核准止水裝置試驗範圍，保留最不利組合；設備與土建負責人共同確認幾何條件，任何材料或尺寸變更需重新審查介面。~Compare opening survey, machine diameter and pose with the approved seal test envelope, retaining adverse combinations; equipment and civil leads jointly confirm geometry and review the interface after material or dimensional changes.||機器偏斜可能一側擠壞密封而另一側失去接觸，平均壓縮仍正常；若以增加單側作用力補救而未審查，還可能加劇井口或機器偏位。~Misalignment can overcompress one side and lose contact on the other despite a normal mean. An unreviewed unilateral correction may worsen opening or machine displacement rather than restore a compatible interface.
角度誤差與穿越長度~Angular error through the opening||機器中心位置正確但姿態偏斜，沿穿越長度仍會產生側向偏差，影響止水接觸與井壁淨距。坐標點與機器軸線必須一起審查，不能以某一瞬間中心點在容許圈內就接受全部幾何。~A correctly located center with wrong attitude develops lateral error along the crossing length, affecting contact and clearance. Review position and axis together rather than accepting the whole geometry from one center point inside a tolerance circle.||假設穿越長10 m、角偏0.2°，側向偏差10tan0.2°=34.91 mm；非允許偏角。~For assumed crossing length 10 m and angular error 0.2°, lateral deviation is 10tan0.2°=34.91 mm, not an allowable angle.||以獨立測量核對機器前後基準點和井口軸線，將位置、俯仰及偏航轉成最小淨距；測量與設備工程師確認坐標轉換和誤差包絡，不能只以導航畫面單點顯示取代。~Independently survey front and rear references and the opening axis, converting position, pitch and yaw into minimum clearance; survey and equipment engineers verify transformations and uncertainty rather than relying on one navigation-screen point.||長機身的小角偏可在後方形成大碰撞風險，目標點桿臂設定錯誤又會讓畫面中心看似正確；若未核對整體輪廓，止水和結構都受影響。~A small angular error produces large rear-envelope displacement on a long machine, while wrong target lever arms make the displayed center appear correct. Unchecked full-envelope geometry threatens both sealing and structure.
反力架與暫態傳力~Reaction frame and temporary load paths||始發推進反力須經核准的支承系統傳到井體或基礎，受力位置與剛度會影響機器對準。到達時支承重新分配也可能形成局部荷載，永久井壁分析不能自動涵蓋這些集中暫態作用。~Launch reaction transfers through approved supports into shaft or foundation, with location and stiffness affecting alignment. Reception redistributes support and can create concentrated loads not automatically covered by permanent shaft-wall analysis.||假設反力4 MN由4個理想等剛度支點均分，平均1 MN/點；偏心及不等剛度須另算。~Assume 4 MN reaction shared by 4 ideally equal-stiffness supports; the mean is 1 MN each, with eccentricity and stiffness differences assessed separately.||核對實際反力點、連接及井體受力圖，利用合格分析或量測檢查分配與變形；臨時工程設計者簽認受力路徑和階段，不以總承載除支點數當完整結構驗證。~Check actual reaction points, connections and shaft load paths with qualified analysis or measurements of sharing and movement; temporary-works designers approve stages rather than treating total capacity divided by support count as full verification.||單一支點間隙可使其他支點超載，反力架轉動又會把幾何誤差帶到止水介面；如果只看總反力，局部破壞和偏移都可能被掩蓋。~A gap at one support overloads others, and frame rotation transfers alignment error to the seal interface. Total reaction alone can conceal both localized structural distress and machine displacement.
觀測鏈與過渡確認~Observation chains and transition checks||過渡區的量測須同時涵蓋水、土、機器和井體，單一無漏水觀察不能證明沒有地層流失。每項資料要對齊機器位置與階段，讓任何偏離可以回到具體屏障與責任人。~Transition monitoring covers water, ground, machine and shaft. No visible leakage alone does not prove absence of ground loss. Align all observations with machine position and stage so deviations map to a barrier and responsible owner.||假設6項關鍵觀測中5項有效、1項失聯，有效率83.3%；失聯不能填成正常零值。~If 5 of an assumed 6 critical observations are valid and 1 is offline, validity is 83.3%; missing data must not be filled as a normal zero.||以模擬事件演練壓力、流量、濁度、位移和姿態資料的同步比對，核對失聯警報與備援；主管工程師指定每階段必要證據，未取得時依既定計畫處理而非以多數正常通過。~Rehearse synchronized pressure, flow, turbidity, movement and pose using simulated events and verify dropout alarms and backups; engineers define stage-specific evidence, with missing data handled by the approved plan rather than majority-normal voting.||井內無明顯漏水可能因水土暫時流向其他空間，單靠肉眼會延遲辨識；資料不同步又會把先後關係倒置，使處置誤對錯誤階段。~Lack of visible shaft leakage may mean flow is temporarily directed elsewhere, delaying visual detection. Unsynchronized records can reverse event order and direct the response to the wrong transition stage.
停留情境與既定回應~Hold scenarios and predetermined responses||過渡區若停留，材料時間效應、外水與支承狀態仍持續變化，所以停留情境需在事前設計。回應必須由核准專業團隊決定，學徒的角色是理解何種證據使原模型失效，並正確通報。~During a transition hold, material aging, water loading and support conditions continue changing. Plan such scenarios beforehand, with responses controlled by approved specialists; the learner identifies evidence invalidating the model and communicates it correctly.||假設資料更新間隔2 min、傳輸3 min、確認5 min，單次資訊等待尺度10 min；不是允許停留時間。~Assume update interval 2 min, transmission 3 min and confirmation 5 min; information delay totals 10 min, not an allowable hold duration.||審查停留期間所需的連續觀測與備援通訊，演練責任人接收、核對和升級流程；正式停留、復工或維護仍依個案核准方案，不能由算例延遲自行制定時間限制。~Review continuous observations and backup communication during holds and rehearse acknowledgment and escalation; stopping, restarting and maintenance remain governed by the approved project plan, not a limit derived from illustrative data latency.||把資料延遲當成工程可等待時間會混淆量測能力與地層容忍度，長停留下材料變化又可能使原驗證失效；未明示此界線會造成錯誤信心。~Treating information latency as permissible engineering delay confuses monitoring ability with ground tolerance. Material changes during a long hold can also invalidate earlier verification, creating false confidence if that boundary is unstated.
介面證據與接管~Interface evidence and takeover||始發到達完成後仍需查核井口、接縫和鄰近地層的延時反應，過渡成功不等於永久止水自動合格。交接要分開暫時與永久系統，保存屏障變更和量測歷程，讓營運方明白剩餘責任。~After launch or reception, delayed shaft, joint and ground response still needs review. A successful transition does not automatically qualify permanent waterproofing; separate temporary and permanent systems and retain barrier changes and monitoring for operational handover.||假設10項永久交接條件有9項完成，90%不能取代尚未驗證的1項止水介面；逐項審查優先於平均。~If 9 of an assumed 10 permanent handover conditions are complete, 90% cannot substitute for one unverified sealing interface; individual review takes precedence over the average.||對照竣工幾何、永久止水試驗、地層監測和異常處置，將臨時設備移除後的邊界另行確認；土建、設備、地工及業主共同簽認接管條件，不把施工節點完成當全案性能證明。~Reconcile as-built geometry, permanent sealing tests, ground monitoring and responses and confirm boundaries after temporary equipment removal; civil, equipment, geotechnical and owner leads jointly approve takeover rather than equating a construction milestone with full performance.||臨時密封拆除後若永久接縫尚未完整，原本未漏水的證據已不適用；竣工圖未記處理變更也會讓未來漏水診斷找不到真實介面。~Evidence of no leakage ceases to apply when temporary seals are removed before permanent joints are complete. Missing treatment changes on as-builts also prevent future diagnosis from locating the real interface.
''')
 compact('b145','把坐標基準、機身姿態與環片幾何連成可獨立查核的導航鏈~Link coordinate datum, machine attitude and ring geometry in an independently checkable navigation chain',['vmt-navigation','amberg-survey'],r'''
控制網與坐標基準~Control networks and coordinate datum||隧道導航從地表控制延伸到洞內測站再到機器目標，任何基準轉換錯誤都會沿鏈傳遞。坐標系、軸向、單位及高程需在同一版本，畫面上的小偏差只有在基準正確時才有意義。~Navigation transfers surface control through underground stations to machine targets, propagating datum errors along the chain. Coordinate frame, axes, units and elevation must share a version; small displayed offsets matter only within the correct datum.||假設本地點距轉換原點1000 m，尺度錯誤10 ppm產生10 mm位置差；非儀器隨機誤差。~At an assumed distance 1000 m from a transformation origin, a 10 ppm scale error creates 10 mm position error, not random instrument noise.||以獨立控制點檢查坐標轉換、尺度和高程，保存轉換矩陣與版本；測量主管須確認設計線形、機器與竣工資料使用同一基準，不能只比對某一重合原點。~Check transformations, scale and elevation at independent controls and retain matrices and versions; the survey lead confirms a common datum for design alignment, machine and as-built data rather than checking one coincident origin alone.||原點吻合但尺度或旋轉錯誤可在長距離逐步放大，施工前段看似正常後段才偏離；若更換坐標版本未通知設備端，導航顯示會產生假跳動。~A matching origin with wrong scale or rotation diverges over distance, appearing normal early and failing later. An uncommunicated datum revision can also create a false jump on the navigation display.
方位精度與遠距傳遞~Azimuth precision over distance||長隧道方向誤差會隨距離放大，角度精度與位置精度必須分別規劃。多次測站轉接可能累積相關偏差，單次儀器精度不能直接當作全線貫通精度，需用網平差和獨立方向控制。~Angular error grows into lateral position error along a long tunnel. Repeated station transfers can accumulate correlated bias, so one instrument rating is not a breakthrough-accuracy estimate; network adjustment and independent orientation are required.||假設視距300 m、角度誤差1.5 arcsec，側向尺度300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm；未含設站誤差。~Assume sight distance 300 m and angular error 1.5 arcsec; lateral scale is 300×1.5/206265=2.18 mm, excluding station error.||以正倒鏡、多測回及獨立方向基準核對方位，將設站、對中與角度不確定分項傳播；測量工程師應檢查相關性，不能把每測段誤差都當互相抵消。~Check azimuth with face reversals, repeated sets and independent direction references, propagating station, centering and angular uncertainties separately; survey engineers assess correlation rather than assuming segment errors cancel each other.||對中誤差或折射若總朝同一側會形成系統曲線偏差，增加相同幾何的測次未必改善；忽略共同偏差可能得到過度樂觀的貫通估計。~Consistently directed centering or refraction creates systematic alignment drift that repeating identical geometry may not reduce. Ignoring common bias produces an overly optimistic estimate of eventual breakthrough accuracy.
陀螺定向與漂移~Gyro orientation and drift||陀螺提供不依賴長視線的方向資訊，但仍需校準、溫度與時間穩定性檢查。它不是自動真值，應與光學控制形成獨立比較，並辨識兩者是否共享同一坐標轉換偏差。~Gyro orientation avoids dependence on a long sight line but still requires calibration and thermal and temporal checks. It is not automatic truth; compare it independently with optical control while identifying any shared datum bias.||假設方向偏差0.001 rad，在100 m投影造成約100 mm側移；小角近似e=Lθ。~Assume direction bias 0.001 rad; projection over 100 m gives approximately 100 mm lateral error through e=Lθ.||在已知方位基線做前後校驗，保留儀器溫度、觀測時間與漂移修正；比較陀螺和光學差值隨時間變化，超出核准不確定範圍時先查量測鏈，不自行選較順眼結果。~Calibrate before and after on a known azimuth and retain temperature, time and drift corrections; track gyro-optical disagreement and investigate the chain outside approved uncertainty rather than selecting the more convenient result.||校準基線若本身錯誤，陀螺和後續資料可能一致卻共同偏轉；未保存漂移歷程又會把溫度效應誤判成機器實際轉向。~A faulty calibration baseline makes subsequent gyro observations consistently wrong, while missing drift history allows thermal effects to masquerade as actual steering. Agreement within that shared chain does not establish correctness.
目標桿臂與機身姿態~Target lever arms and machine attitude||導航量到的是目標點，再透過機身幾何換算刀盤中心與軸線。俯仰、偏航與滾轉都會影響桿臂投影，目標安裝後移位或模型版本錯誤，即使測量本身準確也會顯示錯誤機位。~Navigation observes targets and transforms them through machine geometry to the cutterhead and axis. Pitch, yaw and roll alter lever-arm projection; a moved target or wrong geometry version creates incorrect machine position despite accurate measurement.||假設目標距刀盤中心10 m、偏航0.1°，橫向桿臂修正10sin0.1°=17.45 mm；非可忽略常數。~Assume target-to-cutterhead lever arm 10 m and yaw 0.1°; lateral correction is 10sin0.1°=17.45 mm, not a negligible constant.||以獨立機身基準量測目標位置，核對三維旋轉順序與單位，維修後重新查驗；將顯示刀盤坐標與外部測量比較，設備和測量主管共同確認幾何模型版本。~Independently survey target positions relative to machine references and check rotation order and units after maintenance; compare displayed cutterhead coordinates with external measurements and jointly approve geometry versions through equipment and survey leads.||只做平移而漏掉旋轉會使長桿臂偏差放大，目標支架鬆動又可能被控制系統當成機器偏離；追逐錯誤導航訊號會造成真實線形修正過度。~Applying translation without rotation amplifies long-lever errors, while a loose target bracket can mimic machine deviation. Steering in response to that false signal creates real overcorrection of the alignment.
設計線形與里程投影~Design alignment and chainage projection||機器位置要投影到三維設計線形才能得到里程及橫縱偏差，曲線與縱坡使最近點不等同平面直線投影。線形版本和里程起算點需鎖定，否則各系統可能用不同名義位置討論同一環。~Machine coordinates must project onto the three-dimensional design alignment to give chainage and offsets. Curvature and grade invalidate a simple planar projection, requiring a locked alignment version and station origin across systems.||假設水平前進100 m、縱坡2%，高程變化2 m，斜長√(100²+2²)=100.020 m；里程定義須明示。~Assume 100 m horizontal advance on a 2% grade; elevation changes 2 m and slope length is 100.020 m, requiring an explicit chainage convention.||以已知曲線點和坡度點測試軟體投影，核對里程斷鏈與單位，將偏差向量畫在局部切線坐標；設計及測量團隊需共同核准線形更新，不能只交換沒有版本的坐標表。~Test software projection on known curve and grade points, checking station equations and units and plotting offsets in a local tangent frame; design and survey teams approve alignment revisions rather than exchanging unversioned coordinate tables.||平面里程與斜距混用會逐步累積環號錯配，曲線左右符號用反又會顛倒修正方向；坐標數字合理仍不能保證工程定義一致。~Mixing horizontal chainage with slope distance progressively misassigns rings, while reversed left-right signs invert correction direction. Numerically plausible coordinates do not establish consistent engineering definitions across the workflow.
曲線組環與楔形量~Curved ring building and taper||楔形環片透過端面厚度差逐環改變軸線，旋轉組環可調整轉彎方向，但可達曲率受幾何與接縫限制。導航建議需和環片配置、尾隙及止水變形共同審查，不只是追逐中心線。~Tapered rings change axis direction through face-width differences, with ring rotation selecting direction. Achievable curvature depends on geometry and joints, requiring navigation choices to respect ring layout, tail clearance and gasket deformation rather than centerline alone.||假設環寬1.5 m、曲率半徑300 m，每環轉角約L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°；為小角近似。~Assume ring width 1.5 m and curvature radius 300 m; turn per ring is approximately L/R=0.005 rad=0.286°, a small-angle approximation.||用核准環片幾何模型重算可達轉角，對照實際組環方向、接縫錯台與尾隙；測量和結構工程師檢查累積幾何，任何組環選擇仍由現場核准程序決定，算例不發出拼裝指令。~Recalculate achievable rotation from approved ring geometry and compare orientation, joint offset and tail clearance; survey and structural leads check accumulation, while actual ring selection follows approved site procedures rather than this calculation.||只求快速回到中心線可能使用過大曲率，造成接縫張開或尾刷偏壓；未記組環方向又使後續竣工線形無法對應到設計的幾何假設。~Rapid centerline recovery can demand excessive curvature and produce joint opening or seal loading. Missing ring orientation records also prevent the as-built alignment from being reconciled with the assumed geometry.
尾隙與機器環片相對位移~Relative machine-ring clearance||刀盤中心在設計線上不代表盾尾與環片同心，機身轉動、環片抬升及變形會改變相對間隙。導航應同時看機器和已裝環的位置，把線形控制與防水、結構介面連起來。~A cutterhead on alignment does not ensure concentric shield tail and lining. Machine rotation, ring uplift and deformation alter relative clearance, requiring both machine and installed-ring positions to connect guidance with sealing and structural interfaces.||假設機器中心右偏12 mm、環中心右偏5 mm，相對偏心7 mm；不能用12 mm直接當尾隙偏差。~Assume machine center 12 mm right and ring center 5 mm right; relative eccentricity is 7 mm, not the full 12 mm machine offset.||同時量測尾隙、機身姿態與最新環片中心，使用同一坐標和時刻比較；將局部最大間隙與核准設備包絡核對，偏差原因由測量、設備和組環負責人共同辨識。~Measure clearance, pose and latest ring center at a common time and datum; compare local extreme gaps with the approved equipment envelope and jointly identify causes through survey, equipment and ring-building leads.||忽略環片浮起會把尾隙變化全歸機器偏航，錯誤修正可能進一步壓傷密封；只看平均中心差又會漏掉橢圓化造成的局部接觸不足。~Ignoring ring uplift attributes every gap change to machine yaw and can worsen seal loading through incorrect correction. Mean center difference also misses local contact loss caused by ring ovalization.
折射環境與品質旗標~Refraction environment and quality flags||隧道熱流和粉塵影響光學測量，量測仍有數字不代表品質正常。環境造成的偏差可能具有方向性，應利用多基準或不同時段交叉檢查，並讓品質旗標隨導航結果一同傳遞。~Heat flow and dust affect optical observations, and a numeric output does not ensure good quality. Directional environmental bias requires multiple references or time-separated checks, with quality flags traveling alongside the navigation result.||假設兩次同點讀值相差6 mm、各標準不確定2 mm且獨立，差值標準不確定2.83 mm，差約2.12倍。~Two assumed observations differ by 6 mm with independent 2 mm standard uncertainties each; difference uncertainty is 2.83 mm and the discrepancy is about 2.12 times it.||記錄可視、溫度與儀器追蹤狀態，對照穩定參考點及備援量測，判斷共模偏差；不佳品質時由測量主管依核准程序確認資料用途，不能平滑後隱藏環境事件。~Record visibility, temperature and tracking status and compare stable references and backup observations for common bias; survey leads determine acceptable use under approved procedures rather than smoothing environmental events out of the record.||熱折射可能使多點一致偏移，濾波後曲線更平順卻更像真實轉向；若品質旗標未傳到決策端，系統會對低可信度數值給出過度確定的判讀。~Thermal refraction can shift many points together, and filtering makes the false trend resemble genuine steering. Missing quality flags cause the decision layer to treat low-confidence observations as definite positions.
資料融合與共同偏差~Data fusion and common bias||兩個獨立無偏量測可按不確定度加權降低隨機誤差，但共享控制點或相機模型時並不獨立。融合前需列出共同來源，否則算出的精度提升只是重複計算同一證據。~Independent unbiased measurements can be weighted to reduce random error, but shared controls or geometry create dependence. Identify common sources before fusion or the apparent improvement simply counts the same evidence more than once.||假設獨立標準不確定2與3 mm，融合u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm；有共同偏差時不適用。~For assumed independent standard uncertainties 2 and 3 mm, fused u=1/√(1/2²+1/3²)=1.664 mm, inapplicable to a shared bias.||繪製各感測器到坐標基準的依賴圖，檢查共同校準和時間戳，使用未參與融合的控制點驗證；演算法負責人保留權重與異常剔除紀錄，不以多感測器數量宣稱獨立性。~Map dependencies from sensors to datum, checking shared calibration and clocks and validating against unused controls; algorithm owners retain weights and rejection records rather than asserting independence from sensor count alone.||兩套系統共用錯誤基準可精密地同意一個錯位置，融合後不確定度卻更小；將不同時刻的機位合併又會把真實運動當成量測分歧。~Two systems sharing a wrong datum can agree precisely on the wrong position while fusion reports smaller uncertainty. Combining different epochs additionally mistakes genuine machine movement for disagreement between observations.
貫通檢核與竣工交接~Breakthrough checks and as-built handover||導航完整性最後需由獨立控制和竣工幾何驗證，閉合差是整條量測鏈的結果而非某台儀器單獨績效。交接保存設計線、實際環片和機器歷程，讓誤差來源可分辨並供後續淨空與維護使用。~Independent control and as-built geometry ultimately verify navigation. Closure reflects the whole measurement chain, not one instrument's performance. Preserve design, installed rings and machine history for error diagnosis, clearance assessment and future maintenance.||假設獨立零均值橫向隨機誤差的標準不確定度分量10、12、9 mm，RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm；系統偏差另列。~Assume standard-uncertainty components of independent zero-mean lateral errors of 10,12 and 9 mm; RSS=√(100+144+81)=18.03 mm, with systematic biases reported separately.||以不共享全部基準的獨立測網檢查貫通與竣工線形，追查閉合差的方向及沿程分布；測量、設計及業主共同確認未解決偏差、資料版本與適用精度，不能只交單一最終座標。~Check breakthrough and as-built alignment with an independently constrained network and examine closure direction and distribution; survey, design and owner leads accept remaining deviations, versions and accuracy limits rather than receiving only one final coordinate.||事後強制平差到零會抹去真實閉合證據，若不保留原始值就無法辨識施工偏差與測量偏差；未交環片實際幾何也會影響營運淨空判斷。~Forcing closure to zero afterward erases evidence unless raw observations are retained, preventing separation of construction and survey error. Missing installed-ring geometry also undermines operational clearance assessment after handover.
''')
